    board: file CF-088 — the selftest board arm greens a board that scripts/boardctl validate rejects
    
    tests/selftest.sh section 7 counts a line as a row when json.loads accepts it, and
    nothing in the suite runs scripts/boardctl validate against the real board (section 8
    covers only --help and the missing-executable path; the guard's test_command is
    tests/selftest.sh; no workflows ship). Measured at 400a5ab on a clone, one fixture at
    a time: null, [], "just-a-string", a duplicate .id and status "bogus_status" each print
    "PASS n/n rows parse / SELFTEST: PASS" while boardctl validate prints "[error] row is
    not a JSON object", "duplicate task id" or "status ... not in vocabulary" and exits 1.
    A row with no .status passes both (gate PASS, validate RESULT: OK with a warning) while
    being invisible to select(.status=="pending").
    
    The row carries the probe string that produced those arms; it clones the checkout into
    mktemp, appends one fixture at a time, prints the gate and validator verdicts, and
    restores the board between arms.
    
    Filed by code-factory-releng-qa-2026-11-03-15-39-07 (GitReins CF-088-QA1).
